{
  "_comment": "Out-of-sample reform-validation set: model-backed provisions of the 2025 One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OBBBA) that policyengine-us models in its baseline. Each row is encoded as the counterfactual patch that turns that provision off. The reform-validation producer merges all row patches into a pre-OBBBA present-law baseline, then scores each component by adding that provision back, so the simulated effect is comparable to JCX-35-25's enactment scores relative to the present-law baseline. Scores are FY2026 conventional/static revenue effects from JCX-35-25 in dollars. Rows with a null score are modeled provisions for which JCX-35-25 does not provide a standalone line.",
